.TH SDL_iOSAnimationCallback 3type "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 DATATYPES"
.SH NAME
SDL_iOSAnimationCallback \- The prototype for an Apple iOS animation callback.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_system.h>
.PP
.BI "typedef void (SDLCALL *SDL_iOSAnimationCallback)(void *userdata);
.fi
.SH DESCRIPTION
This datatype is only useful on Apple iOS\[char46]
.PP
After passing a function pointer of this type to
.BR SDL_SetiOSAnimationCallback ,
the system will call that function pointer at a regular interval\[char46]

.SH FUNCTION PARAMETERS
.TP
.I userdata
what was passed as
.BR callbackParam
to
.BR SDL_SetiOSAnimationCallback
as
.BR callbackParam \[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This datatype is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

.SH SEE ALSO
.BR SDL_SetiOSAnimationCallback (3)
